/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I got the following warning:\r\n&quot;In lav_test_diff_SatorraBentler2001(mods[[m]], mods[[m + 1]]) :</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> lavaan WARNING: scaling\r\nfactor is negative&quot; </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">and don&#39;t understand this\r\nwarning and don&#39;t know if it is relevant for me.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">It may be that the scaling factor\r\nis negative, because my items differ in polarity. Certainly 40% of the items\r\nare negative. Could I take the values anyway or are the values with this\r\nwarning useless for me? </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.00